{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Integrate the Adyen Issuing SDK into your iOS application."}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.adyen.CardProvisioningSessions\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs"]]},"kind":"article","primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The Adyen Issuing SDK provides a suite of features for managing payment instruments in your iOS app:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Card Provisioning Sessions","type":"text"}]},{"text":" — Add payment cards to Apple Wallet","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Card Sessions","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — Securely reveal card details (PAN, CVC, expiry), reveal PIN, and change PIN (Work in Progress)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This guide covers the common setup steps required for all SDK features."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Prerequisites","type":"heading","anchor":"Prerequisites"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Before you begin, you must obtain a certificate from Adyen. This certificate is required to initialize the SDK.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"text":"Embed the Certificate","type":"heading","anchor":"Embed-the-Certificate"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Take the certificate provided by Adyen and embed it directly into your app’s main bundle."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Fetch a Session Token","anchor":"Fetch-a-Session-Token"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"All SDK features require a session token from the Adyen API. Your backend needs to fetch this token for the specific payment instruments.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":